{"max_tokens":8192,"messages":[{"content":"Follow the public QA protocol in the user message. It contains the current task, evidence, state, tool/interface rules and strict response schemas. Make the choices required by that interface and return exactly one allowed JSON Action, Update, or Final. Use only this request. Do not output Markdown, private reasoning or native tool calls. Do not invent evidence or alter the contract.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"context\":{\"answer_unit\":\"percent\",\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_context:f90daed2d1a4e5cc3e535f49a9674db7c543134aee8245fa9cfe09d05d9d578c\",\"indexing\":\"source:tROWcCOLUMNnNUMBER, source:pPRE_PARAGRAPHnNUMBER, source:qPOST_PARAGRAPHnNUMBER; zero based. All numeric spans are uniformly indexed, including years and OCR artifacts. Indexing does not certify relevance or units.\",\"information_condition\":\"F\",\"numeric_catalog\":[{\"end\":34,\"id\":\"source:t0c0n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t0c0\",\"start\":33,\"token\":\"1\",\"value\":\"1\"},{\"end\":39,\"id\":\"source:t0c0n1\",\"index\":1,\"segment\":\"t0c0\",\"start\":35,\"token\":\"2007\",\"value\":\"2007\"},{\"end\":8,\"id\":\"source:t0c1n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t0c1\",\"start\":2,\"token\":\"201808\",\"value\":\"201808\"},{\"end\":49,\"id\":\"source:t1c0n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t1c0\",\"start\":45,\"token\":\"2013\",\"value\":\"2013\"},{\"end\":5,\"id\":\"source:t1c1n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t1c1\",\"start\":0,\"token\":\"14009\",\"value\":\"14009\"},{\"end\":49,\"id\":\"source:t2c0n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t2c0\",\"start\":45,\"token\":\"2013\",\"value\":\"2013\"},{\"end\":5,\"id\":\"source:t2c1n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t2c1\",\"start\":0,\"token\":\"11350\",\"value\":\"11350\"},{\"end\":6,\"id\":\"source:t3c1n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t3c1\",\"start\":0,\"token\":\"-81213\",\"value\":\"-81213\"},{\"end\":5,\"id\":\"source:t4c1n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t4c1\",\"start\":0,\"token\":\"-3512\",\"value\":\"-3512\"},{\"end\":